{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>New technologies mean new threats:</i></strong> Viruses are now sentient and the Antiviruses of old are no longer effective. As Astro-Fox, your goal is to build the ultimate antivirus in order to erradicate the viruses from your computer before they overrun it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RogueVirus is a grid-based game with elements from bullet-hell and roguelike genres. Dodge relentless attacks from your enemies and strike them with a wide variety of commands to delete them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.poster.avif?t=1766585127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.webm?t=1766585127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.mp4?t=1766585127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grid-based combat in real-time:</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>The game is played on a board composed of up to 21 cells in which you have to quickly move to dodge attacks and ambush enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dozens of unique attacks and upgrades:\u00a0</i></strong>Collect powerful commands to make your own antivirus and upgrade it using add-ons to gain new properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rule-breaking enemies:</i></strong>\u00a0Not all viruses are the same, some of them will completely ignore the rules of the game taking you off-guard if you're not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Randomly generated levels:</strong></i> Each level is composed of multiple random sectors for you to explore in order to find items, stores or even allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1792430?t=1766585127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766585127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/0afeda37be26f9cf54d9ad0f87b70a8a42653490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766585127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/0afeda37be26f9cf54d9ad0f87b70a8a42653490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766585127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>New technologies mean new threats:</i></strong> Viruses are now sentient and the Antiviruses of old are no longer effective. As Astro-Fox, your goal is to build the ultimate antivirus in order to erradicate the viruses from your computer before they overrun it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RogueVirus is a grid-based game with elements from bullet-hell and roguelike genres. Dodge relentless attacks from your enemies and strike them with a wide variety of commands to delete them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.poster.avif?t=1766585127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.webm?t=1766585127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/ffe2c8c4d81e4396dd4076243905e596.mp4?t=1766585127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grid-based combat in real-time:</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>The game is played on a board composed of up to 21 cells in which you have to quickly move to dodge attacks and ambush enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dozens of unique attacks and upgrades:\u00a0</i></strong>Collect powerful commands to make your own antivirus and upgrade it using add-ons to gain new properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rule-breaking enemies:</i></strong>\u00a0Not all viruses are the same, some of them will completely ignore the rules of the game taking you off-guard if you're not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Randomly generated levels:</strong></i> Each level is composed of multiple random sectors for you to explore in order to find items, stores or even allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Huskyware"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/header.jpg?t=1766585127","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1792430/835233/434a